        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This content is the exclusive bonus for pre-orders of Double Dragon Revive. It is not available for separate purchase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dream collaboration between the legendary belt-scroll action series Double Dragon and the beloved sports game River City Dodge Ball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Double Dragon characters step onto the field for some dodge ball action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand against the schemes of the evil kingpin Willy and his Shadow Warriors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 54 characters from throughout the series join the fray, including the Lee brothers, Marian, and the Shadow Warriors led by their arch-rival Willie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful dodgeball battles utilizing special moves unfold across stages unique to Double Dragon, such as city streets and ancient ruins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring Diverse Game Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Story Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Lee Brothers to challenge the Shadow Warriors and rescue Marian!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Duel Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive nostalgic team battles in 1-on-1 matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Survival Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out with up to 4 players until only one remains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the legendary dodgeball battle with your own hands, right now!</p>",
